Phosphor BASIC 0.0.1 -- REPL. Variables and functions persist across lines.
Type a multi-line block and it waits for the terminator. Ctrl+Z then Enter to quit.
phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> 42
phosphor> phosphor> plain text still prints
phosphor> 3
phosphor> phosphor> and the session kept its variables: 42
phosphor>      ...>      ...> phosphor> and can still define and call: 42
phosphor> 
